Message-ID: <5abc11d80802051042h4f5bb52w4d026fc6dcab1810@mail.gmail.com>

Stata uses adaptive Gauss-Hermite quadrature while the default algorithm for
LME4 (which Zelig uses internally) is Laplace approximation. Maybe you can
try using adaptive Gauss-Hermite quadrature in LME4 and see if things change
a bit.

Shige

